{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115212132838-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115220012\"/><p>其中2名南亞漢頭部受傷。(陳嘉順攝)</p><p>深水埗南亞兵團內訌群毆。今晚(15日)8時30分，兩批南亞漢在南昌街69號對開休憩公園打鬥，雙方更在街頭互相追逐，當中有人持利刀，途人見狀報案。警員接報趕至現場，參與毆鬥的南亞漢即雞飛狗走四散，但6人被截獲，其中2人頭部受傷，並拘捕1人。救護員替受傷南亞漢包紮傷口，警員要求其他南亞漢一字排開接受調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:22:13.307014+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T13:21:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:56:59.124943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:15:42.260423+00:00","content_hash":"aedf66e550a9df329224ac78eb2c46e651edd193970a858d883947daecb03455","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:22:13.307014+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}